---
title: Snippets
layout: home
description: Code worth keeping — the thing itself, what it is for, and one button that copies it. Because copying it is the only interaction anybody ever wants from a snippet.
eyebrow: Collections
source: src/components/commerce.css · code.css
---
<section class="im-section im-wrap" style="padding-top: 1.5rem; --im-section-gap: 1.5rem">
